# ==============================================================================
# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES CONFIGURATION ARCHIVE — ARYAN KELKAR PORTFOLIO
# ==============================================================================
# All variables below are OPTIONAL with resilient fallback defaults.
# When deploying to Vercel, configure these in Project Settings -> Environment Variables.

# 1. Canonical Site URL (Used for generating absolute sitemap & Open Graph URLs)
# Default fallback: https://aryankelkar.dev
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://aryankelkar.dev

# 2. Contact Notification Destination (Used for contact form email routing)
# Default fallback: configured in src/data/profile.ts
CONTACT_NOTIFICATION_EMAIL=aryan.kelkar@example.com
